    "sent-to-without-a-peer-acknowledgement": {
      "comment": "File transfer status. The argument is the recipient's IRC nickname. All offered bytes were sent and the peer closed cleanly, but the peer sent no DCC acknowledgement. Do not imply verified receipt or storage.",
